    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it feels like you're being a bit too soft on them. you're saying they provide 'order' but even you admitted they're basically teethless when a major power wants to do whatever it wants. isn't the 'neutral framework' just an illusion if the people in charge of it are the ones breaking it? it seems like the reality is just a way to legitimize whoever has the most power.",
